\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.6}{\ignorespaces Diagram illustrating the waterline extraction pipeline for traditional spectral indices. The process involves a three-step sequence: (1) calculation of the continuous spectral index raster, (2) application of the cutoff threshold to create a binary mask, and (3) extraction of the waterline vector using the Marching Squares contouring algorithm.}}{41}{}\protected@file@percent }
